NCT01886222.eligibility_criteria:
Inclusion Criteria:

* Age 18 - 65 years within 6 hours post injury;
* Closed head injury;
* Glasgow Coma Scale(GCS) score 4 to 8 after resuscitation;
* The intracranial pressure is more than 25 mmHg;
